---
const faqs = [
  {
    question:
      "Can LKProfessionals build a complete e-commerce website?",
    answer:
      "Yes. E-commerce projects can include catalogue structure, product pages, cart, checkout, payment integrations, customer accounts and agreed operational workflows.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can an online store integrate with inventory or POS software?",
    answer:
      "Where suitable APIs or supported integration methods are available, storefront, inventory, POS and other systems can be connected.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can product and order updates be automated?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Predictable events such as order confirmation, status changes, notifications and selected data synchronisation can often be automated.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can you develop a custom commerce platform instead of using standard store software?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Custom development can be appropriate when pricing, catalogue structure, workflows, integrations or business rules cannot be handled adequately by standard e-commerce platforms.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can LKProfessionals help bring more traffic to an online store?",
    answer:
      "Yes. SEO, paid acquisition, content and other digital marketing services can be used to improve discoverability and customer acquisition.",
  },
  {
    question:
      "Can analytics show which products and campaigns are performing?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Reporting can be developed around product sales, order values, campaign performance and other available business data, provided tracking and source data are implemented reliably.",
  },
];
---

<section class="retail-faq">
  <div class="site-container retail-faq__layout">
    <div>
      <p>Retail & e-commerce FAQ</p>

      <h2>
        Questions to settle before adding another plugin to the store.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="retail-faq__list">
      {
        faqs.map((faq) => (
          <details>
            <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
            <p>{faq.answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .retail-faq {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .retail-faq__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns:
      minmax(17rem, 0.7fr)
      minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .retail-faq__layout
    > div:first-child > p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #0b2f8f;
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .retail-faq h2 {
    max-width: 12ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: #0d203c;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .retail-faq__list {
    border-top: 1px solid #dce3ec;
  }

  .retail-faq details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dce3ec;
    padding-block: 1rem;
  }

  .retail-faq summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #293b53;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 740;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .retail-faq details p {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    color: #788497;
    font-size: 0.69rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .retail-faq__layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
